/** `studio_project` — Director project. Editor (per-shot) projects: list, open, create from a brief or template, change settings, move from review to rendering, and manage saved versions. Use it to start or inspect a project before editing shots with `studio_shots`, layers with `studio_layers`, audio with `studio_audio` and export with `studio_export`. A single spend over 50 HWT first returns `needs_confirmation` with a `confirm_token`; repeat the identical call with the token after the user agrees. */
